  "notes": "Adds a saved Desktop Shortcut setting to the main app toolbar. Turn it on to create an AO3 Skin Studio shortcut on the Windows desktop; turn it off to remove the app-created shortcut. The preference persists between launches and the shortcut points to the current app executable so it continues working through in-place updates. Keeps the complete AO3 Required-Tag Grid editor, Color Studio, Gradient Studio, GIF support, Split Screen, and all prior tools."
